tempest-dev.db

# C6: run artifacts of the vendored data layer's own jest harness — coverage, the jest-junit
# report, and winston's daily-rotate log files. All three are written by upstream's config, so
# they can only be ignored here: `packages/platform/data/.gitignore` is vendored and editing it
# would be an inline delta for build output (L27).
packages/platform/data/coverage/
packages/platform/data/junit.xml
packages/platform/data/logs/
